WEBVTT

00:00:09,390 --> 00:00:15,750
And I use my phone while running the rice machine.

00:00:15,750 --> 00:00:19,750
So if you're laying down, sitting down,

00:00:19,750 --> 00:00:22,270
running your rice machine, can you pick up your phone

00:00:22,270 --> 00:00:23,830
and talk to somebody on the phone?

00:00:23,830 --> 00:00:27,750
Can you go on the internet and scroll Facebook

00:00:27,750 --> 00:00:29,390
while you're doing the rife?

00:00:29,390 --> 00:00:31,590
The answer is yes, you can.

00:00:31,590 --> 00:00:34,350
You may have some interference at different times

00:00:34,350 --> 00:00:36,430
on different frequencies.

00:00:36,430 --> 00:00:38,710
You may goof up your phone a little bit

00:00:38,710 --> 00:00:43,710
or slow down your connection or something like that,

00:00:44,710 --> 00:00:49,430
but no, typically you should not have any problems.

00:00:49,430 --> 00:00:53,270
Will your phone interfere with the frequencies

00:00:53,270 --> 00:00:55,230
coming out of the rife ball

00:00:55,230 --> 00:00:56,910
and interfere with your treatment?

00:00:56,910 --> 00:00:58,470
No, not at all.

00:00:58,470 --> 00:01:00,910
You can, there's no harm.

00:01:00,910 --> 00:01:03,670
In that, it's not going to interfere

00:01:03,670 --> 00:01:07,470
with the frequencies coming out of the rife ball.

00:01:07,470 --> 00:01:10,550
Further questions that I could think of that tie to this.

00:01:10,550 --> 00:01:12,670
Can I use the IMF?

00:01:12,670 --> 00:01:16,390
Can I do the rife while I do my PMF?

00:01:16,390 --> 00:01:17,750
Yes, yes, you can.

00:01:17,750 --> 00:01:20,150
There's a totally different frequencies.

00:01:20,150 --> 00:01:21,350
They're not going to overlap,

00:01:21,350 --> 00:01:23,190
they're not going to cancel each other out.

00:01:23,190 --> 00:01:24,910
You can do that.

00:01:24,910 --> 00:01:28,270
Can I do my red light therapy while I do my rife?

00:01:28,270 --> 00:01:29,710
Yes, you can.

00:01:29,710 --> 00:01:31,830
There's no harm in that.

00:01:31,830 --> 00:01:35,590
So we have a person that does the son of,

00:01:35,590 --> 00:01:37,110
they have kind of rigged it up

00:01:37,110 --> 00:01:40,990
or they bring the ball goes through the door

00:01:40,990 --> 00:01:42,710
and goes into their sauna.

00:01:42,710 --> 00:01:44,230
Is that going to hurt the machine?

00:01:44,230 --> 00:01:48,070
No, no, because I wouldn't bring the machine in the sauna,

00:01:48,070 --> 00:01:50,710
but if the bulb is in there, it should be fine.

00:01:50,710 --> 00:01:54,470
So that person does the rife while he's in the sauna.

00:01:54,470 --> 00:01:55,670
Great.

00:01:55,670 --> 00:01:59,270
So you could try to do more than one thing at a time.

00:01:59,270 --> 00:02:02,590
That's always wise use of time.

00:02:02,590 --> 00:02:05,950
So there shouldn't be any issues with frequencies

00:02:05,950 --> 00:02:08,030
of the cell phone.

00:02:08,030 --> 00:02:10,270
Certainly, we'll not mess up the frequencies,

00:02:10,270 --> 00:02:12,590
the treatment frequencies from the rife.

00:02:12,590 --> 00:02:14,310
The only thing with using your phone

00:02:14,310 --> 00:02:18,350
with the rife could possibly be your phone

00:02:18,350 --> 00:02:21,990
could slow down or you could be groupier or something like that.

00:02:21,990 --> 00:02:24,230
But we haven't had that issue.

